Log in and save platform credentials

Usage:
  mcp-runtime auth login [flags]

Flags:
      --api-url string         Sentinel API base URL (scheme and host, no /api path)
      --email string           Platform account email for password login
  -h, --help                   help for login
      --password string        Platform account password (if omitted with --email, prompt securely in a terminal)
      --profile string         Saved credential profile name (defaults to admin, the email local part, or default)
      --registry-host string   Optional host:port for the platform image registry for later use with docker
      --skip-verify            Store credentials without calling the API to validate the token
      --token string           API token (or use --token-stdin, or the interactive prompt)
      --token-stdin            Read the token from stdin (non-interactive)
      --username string        Alias for --email

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
